  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href='http://www.gpo.gov'>www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. BARROW:\nH.R. 223.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto Article I, Section 4, of the Constitution which expressly\nprovides Congress with the power to enact laws governing the\ntime, place, and manner of elections for Members of the House\nof Representatives.\n[Page H85]\n</pre>",
